# 📊 Self-Service Analytics Dashboard

🚀 **Live App:** https://self-service-analytics-dashboard-qeyjkdqn3vtshmux9kdpnw.streamlit.app/

A self-service analytics web application that allows users to upload data, clean it, build interactive dashboards, analyze insights, save dashboard versions, and export reports — similar to enterprise BI tools like Power BI and Tableau.



## Why This Project?

In real-world analytics, analysts spend time switching between tools for:
- Data cleaning
- Exploratory analysis
- Dashboard creation
- Report export

This project brings the **entire analytics workflow into a single application**, enabling users to go from raw data to insights and reports **without writing code**.


## 👥 Target Users

- Data Analysts
- Business Intelligence Developers
- Product Analysts
- Analytics Engineering Interns
- Students building analytics portfolios


## 🚀 Key Features

### 📤 Data Upload
- Upload CSV or Excel files
- Instant dataset preview

### 🧹 Data Cleaning
- Remove duplicate records
- Handle missing values
- Preview cleaned data
- Download cleaned dataset as CSV

### 📈 Dashboard Builder
- Create interactive charts (Bar, Line, Scatter, Histogram, Box)
- Apply global filters
- Dynamic KPI metrics
- Edit or delete charts
- Drill-down to view underlying data for each visualization

### 📚 Dashboard Versions (Enterprise Feature)
- Save multiple dashboard layouts
- Reload previously saved versions
- Switch between different analytical views instantly

### 🧠 Insights & Analysis
- Dataset overview
- Data quality checks
- Statistical variability detection
- Correlation analysis with heatmap
- Actionable recommendations

### 💾 Export
- Export dashboards as PDF
- Includes:
  - Dataset summary
  - KPIs
  - Applied filters
  - Dashboard visualizations


## Tech Stack:

- Python
- Streamlit
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Plotly
- FPDF
- Kaleido
- OpenPyXL

